# Volkswagen Polo Mk5 (Typ 6R) five-door hatchback, 2009-2017.
#
# The 6R Polo: a single swept headlamp each side, a horizontal grille with the
# VW badge, a more upright body and a five-door shell. The 6C facelift of 2014
# is not modelled separately.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Polo_Mk5
#
# Dimensions 3.952 x 1.682 x 1.454 m, wheelbase 2.470 m.
#
# Shape reference: no true side elevation exists on Commons. The side image is
# the most side-on available, a front three-quarter about 50 degrees to the side
# axis, both wheels visible; the flank is reconciled against the front and rear
# three-quarters within the published dimensions. The limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (d), no UK brochure retrieved. Blue, Silver, Black and Red are
# plain colour names. Weights 10, 9, 8, 8, total 35, provisional pending the
# central rebase.
#
# Speed 190 km/h. Comfort 75/443, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 75. Classes 1,2.
# Dates orders 7 August 2009, deliveries 16 October 2009, to 2017; road tail
# staggered 2032-2035.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-polo-mk5.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/vw-polo-mk5.dae. References: citycars/references/vw-polo-mk5/
# (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: no true side elevation exists; the side image is a front
# three-quarter about 50 degrees to the side axis, and the flank was reconciled
# against both three-quarters and the published dimensions. The roof and window
# corners are more angular, and the nose flatter, than the photographs. Badge,
# grille mesh and reflector detail is simplified. The 6C facelift is not modelled.
# The spoiler passes Stage B in connectivity mode, attached to the hatch.


